      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The most prudent path forward is to provide a detailed \"Not at this time\" as an unconfirmed statement to avoid false speculation while you internally verify the 30-day timeline with security logs. However, immediately after confirming the exact facts, you must prepare a formal, factual disclosure for both the board and the press to prevent rumors from the market interpreting the \"bad\" call as a denial or a cover-up. Waiting for the Reuters deadline without a clear narrative for \"dealing with it\" will likely cause the stock to drop regardless of the actual outcome.",
